Vendored code

vendor/TUImation.Core comes from TUImation, the same author's terminal
animation project (commit c391c5f; QuadRenderer.cs from commit d2f6ae2),
retargeted to net10.0 and changed for this game. It is distributed under this
repository's Apache License 2.0.

Bundled third-party code

The browser version bundles npm packages (the AT Protocol client libraries and
their dependencies, under the MIT, ISC and Apache-2.0 licences) into
wwwroot/atproto.js. The web build writes each package's licence and notice
files to wwwroot/atproto.js.LICENSES.txt, served beside the bundle. xterm.js
(MIT) is served from wwwroot/xterm/ with its LICENSE beside it. The .NET
runtime and its libraries (MIT, .NET Foundation and Contributors, with
third-party parts listed in its notices), compiled to WebAssembly, are served
from wwwroot/_framework/, as is the System.Formats.Cbor NuGet package (MIT, the
same authors). The publish writes their licence and third-party notices beside
them: LICENSE.txt and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt for the runtime, and
<package>.LICENSE.txt and <package>.THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt for each package.
The single-file page holds all of these licence texts in a comment at its top.
